// Pins the three load-bearing properties stated in `stdlib/dialogue/embed.sio`:
//   1. Determinism: embed_into(h) is bit-equal across calls.
//   2. Unit norm:   ||embed_into(h)||_2 = 1.0 within ε.
//   3. Spread:      embed_into for two distinct hashes lands on two
//                   distinct unit vectors (sanity that the table isn't
//                   collapsing to a single row).
//
// The G₂-uniformity property (Halton low-discrepancy + Box-Muller isotropy
// + radial projection) is the M4 Lean obligation; no runtime test claims it.

